-- want --
W009 ajiya.toml: milestone staging-proven comes after launch, but launch already requires every ticket staging-proven does, so staging-proven is reached no later than launch. Fix: put staging-proven first with 'ajiya milestone move staging-proven --before launch', or give staging-proven targets that launch does not require
